 "changes": [
  "Own actual process creation in a retained media-spawn task with an empty request context",
  "Shield actual creation from caller cancellation and retain pending cleanup",
  "Join late startup results within the existing cleanup budget, then reclaim using only remaining time",
  "Keep original startup exceptions for live callers; consume and log only a fixed event for late failures",
  "Expose starting without changing the native spawn implementation or processing budgets"
 ],
